From: Anland packaging maintainers <packaging@anland.invalid>
Date: Tue, 12 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] hyprgrass: port v0.8.2 to Hyprland 0.56 Lua API

Hyprland 0.56 no longer provides the legacy configuration and dispatcher
APIs used by Hyprgrass 0.8.2. Keep the vendored upstream source unchanged
and apply this Debian quilt patch to use the Lua-only interfaces instead.

Forwarded: not-needed
---
 third_party/hyprgrass/src/GestureManager.cpp | 65 ++++++++++-----------------
 third_party/hyprgrass/src/main.cpp          | 43 +++++--------------
 2 files changed, 37 insertions(+), 71 deletions(-)

